<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>js | Bangyou Zheng</title><link>https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/tag/js/</link><atom:link href="https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/tag/js/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>js</description><generator>Wowchemy (https://wowchemy.com)</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/media/logo_hu8419d7c8ed903ebf07025e64caaf36b6_25603_300x300_fit_lanczos_3.png</url><title>js</title><link>https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/tag/js/</link></image><item><title>JS updates position of TOC for Rmarkdown file in blogdown</title><link>https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/</guid><description>&lt;p>The TOC is rendered underneath when using &lt;a href="https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/blogdown/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">blogdown 0.20&lt;/a> to write Rmarkdown file.&lt;/p>
&lt;figure >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img alt="" srcset="
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/blogdown-toc_hua216ac7b64afdad5690ead684f29ea0b_10494_7eb8d70f3b2497033656eceba5d0373e.webp 400w,
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/blogdown-toc_hua216ac7b64afdad5690ead684f29ea0b_10494_b693b610a58e10c42a624a54f6090232.webp 760w,
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/blogdown-toc_hua216ac7b64afdad5690ead684f29ea0b_10494_1200x1200_fit_q75_h2_lanczos_3.webp 1200w"
src="https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/blogdown-toc_hua216ac7b64afdad5690ead684f29ea0b_10494_7eb8d70f3b2497033656eceba5d0373e.webp"
width="50%"
height="583"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;p>However, the current version of hugo &lt;a href="https://github.com/gcushen/hugo-academic/tree/6f36c1624c2f63333a2d912963fa13f91e78782b" target="_blank" rel="noopener">academic theme&lt;/a> is rendered TOC at the right hand side and always keep on the screen which would be more useful.&lt;/p>
&lt;figure >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img alt="" srcset="
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/hugo-toc_hue4bb7d9d05298defed048b01c54365c3_12051_3aebce4fa08029e9cfc914c6a5970699.webp 400w,
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/hugo-toc_hue4bb7d9d05298defed048b01c54365c3_12051_4320df4a256f5d5419decf11f54aea07.webp 760w,
/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/hugo-toc_hue4bb7d9d05298defed048b01c54365c3_12051_1200x1200_fit_q75_h2_lanczos_3.webp 1200w"
src="https://byzheng.github.io/my-website/my-website/post/blogdown-toc/hugo-toc_hue4bb7d9d05298defed048b01c54365c3_12051_3aebce4fa08029e9cfc914c6a5970699.webp"
width="100%"
height="218"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;p>A simple solution is to adjust the position of TOC using js.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Update &lt;code>plugins_js&lt;/code> in the configuration file &lt;code>config\_default\params.toml&lt;/code> into &lt;code>plugins_js = [custom]&lt;/code>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Create a &lt;code>custom.js&lt;/code> under &lt;code>\assets\js\&lt;/code> folder.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Add the js script below into custom.js.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">$&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">document&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">ready&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kd">function&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(){&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// Find TOC
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">toc&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">$&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;#TOC&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">length&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">===&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// Find sidebar
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">sidebar&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">$&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;div.flex-xl-nowrap&amp;gt;div.docs-toc&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">sidebar&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">length&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">sidebar&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">html&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">());&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// Add new class
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">$&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">sidebar&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">find&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;li&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">addClass&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;nav-item&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">$&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">sidebar&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">find&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;li.a&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">addClass&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;nav-link&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">toc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">html&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item></channel></rss>